        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bernardo Mattarella, Piersanti Mattarella, Sergio Mattarella\n- Roles: President of the Italian Republic, President of the Regional Government of Sicily, judge on the Constitutional Court\n- Organizations: Cosa Nostra\n\nFacts:\n- Piersanti Mattarella was President of the Regional Government of Sicily before Cosa Nostra assassinated him in 1980.\n- In 2011, Sergio Mattarella became an elected judge on the Constitutional Court.\n- Since 3 February 2015, Sergio Mattarella has served as President of the Italian Republic.\n- Bernardo Mattarella was the father of Piersanti Mattarella and Sergio Mattarella.\n- Piersanti Mattarella and Sergio Mattarella both became politicians.",
